{"id":"en_the-teacups-between-us","title":"The Teacups Between Us","titleEn":"The Teacups Between Us","description":"Following her mother's passing, novelist Emily Harris discovers a set of old teacups in a Chicago house, each bearing the name of someone she has never met: Helen Morrison. Digging into the connection, she finds that her mother and Helen had once been the closest of friends until their bond was destroyed by their shared love for one man. When Emily finally meets Helen, now elderly, she uncovers decades of quiet endurance and feelings that were never voiced. What emerges is a reconnection between two women who had been separated by pride and heartbreak.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-teacups-between-us/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-teacups-between-us/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Friendship","Love Triangle","Modern Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4ls/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-teacups-between-us_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4ls/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-teacups-between-us_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4ls/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-teacups-between-us_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4ls/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-teacups-between-us_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embe